  <item>
    <title>《认知觉醒》：杀死模糊 治好拖延</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664230d92e74bb361ea15daf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664230d92e74bb361ea15daf</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>为什么紧张的时候大脑会一片空白？</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么懂得很多道理，却很难做到？</span></p><span></span><p><span>做事无限拖拉怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span>思维涣散，总是走神怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span>怎么读书才记得牢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>怎么忽悠大脑改变避难趋易、急于求成的毛病？</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于这些问题，我们在书里找到了一些答案来分享。也欢迎听友们探讨自己行之有效的方法。大家一起“长脑子”🧠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> &nbsp;情绪VS理智，为什么情绪总是占上风</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 为什么一紧张就大脑空白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> 模糊会带来什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">04:46</a> 如何消除模糊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">05:42</a> 宁愿吃苦也不愿意动脑？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 学习的苦要主动去吃，生活的苦躺着它就来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a> 拆解、细化，做自己的项目经理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 为什么道理都懂，但就是做不到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 如何提升能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 为什么学了那么久的外语，还是说不好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1168">19:28</a> 如何养成好习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> 如何聪明地学习？看书一定要梳理思维导图吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1418">23:38</a> 如何把知识变成自己的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1658">27:38</a> 逼自己做不想做的事，就要PUA自己吗</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvuvYaiCItaLzzfgDd0FCFNpMvCb.m4a" length="48308561" type="audio/mp4"/>
