  <item>
    <title>有钱人好像真的以为自己很厉害</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6514fa160432a31578a7665e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6514fa160432a31578a7665e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Sep 2023 03:59:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>李佳琦的事情告了一段落，就好像在湖里丢了一块石头，激起了一阵波澜之后又迅速消散。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是一时之间掀起的关于“精英的傲慢”和“优绩主义”的讨论，不应该立刻消散。</span></p><span></span><p><span>即使我们已经习惯“优胜劣汰”、“金钱至上”的竞争机制；</span></p><span></span><p><span>即使我们个人无法改变“精英们”对下位者的傲慢；</span></p><span></span><p><span>即使发现努力也无法得到合理的回报，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们还是有思考和批判的自由，为自己争得平等和幸福的“地位”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a> ：什么是优绩主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> ：为什么不要相信天道酬勤？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">06:16</a> ：努力不一定有用的话，怎么办呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a> ：只看文凭的面试公平吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> ：优绩主义让成功者丢失了谦卑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a> ：自卑与自大来回切换</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1018">16:58</a> ：努力了也没回报，是否还要拼尽全力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1104">18:24</a> ：世界快毁灭了，保大家还是保自己？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1198">19:58</a> ：为众人抱薪者，不可使其冻毙于风雪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1372">22:52</a> ：努力重要还是运气重要？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1512">25:12</a> ：困在系统里的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2318">38:38</a> ：为什么感同身受很难？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2718">45:18</a> ：比来比去一场空</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Money on my mind—UPSAHL/Absofacto</span></p><span></span><p><span>只为碎银几两—周林枫</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lk7KTMZW67QIrtKIt4TRCwvL7YCx.m4a" length="48037914" type="audio/mp4"/>
