  <item>
    <title>《老友记》挖呀挖，越挖越惊喜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64e457263fa4090b74efc474</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e457263fa4090b74efc474</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Aug 2023 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《老友记》忠粉测试：</span></p><p><span>1、Monica在海边被水母咬了，Joey让她在伤口上撒尿，Joey是怎么知道这个方法的？</span></p><p><span>2、Monica订婚后在阳台大喊“I'm engaged”，Ross听成了什么？</span></p><p><span>3、Monica公寓号多少？</span></p><p><span>4、Chandler的中间名是什么？</span></p><p><span>5、Phoebe小时候抢过Ross什么？</span></p><p><span>（答案见shownotes）</span></p><p><span>多少人为了学英语才看的《老友记》，结果一看就成了十级忠粉？</span></p><p><span>开心也看，不开心也看，我不会到了80岁还在拿《老友记》下饭吧？</span></p><p><span>明明每个角色都有让人无法忍受的小缺点，但怎么个个都惹人爱呢？</span></p><p><span>Phoebe专治精神内耗，Monica打鸡血第一名，Chandler笑话冷人却暖……</span></p><p><span>两位新人有点后悔，第二期就选了这个主题，一聊就停不下来，海量素材剪掉了大半，居然还有两小时。</span></p><p><span>从这密密麻麻的shownotes里也看出我们对《老友记》的爱了吧？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;老友记六人搞直播，会怎么样？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;最喜欢Phoebe，但最像Monica</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1153">19:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;人物放大镜分析—Phoebe</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1264">21:04</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Phoebe的善良是否也有争议？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1368">22:48</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;与万物生灵共情的小天使</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;有固执的原则，但有时候也需要台阶</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;别人的眼光，I don't care</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1542">25:42</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;哲学家Phoebe</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">26:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;神奇身世和奇妙家人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1703">28:23</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;脑电波二人组：Phoebe &amp; Joey</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;Phoebe的童话：收获爱情和家人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2150">35:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;人物放大镜分析—Joey</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">36:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;对朋友仗义的大男孩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2251">37:31</a> “渣男”小Joey</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2304">38:24</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;兄弟如父子：Joey &amp; Chandler</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;人物放大镜分析—Chandler</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2477">41:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;长在我笑点上的男人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;搞笑背后的痛苦故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2633">43:53</a> “怂”男人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2814">46:54</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;互相治愈和成就：Monica &amp; Chandler</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3103">51:43</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;好丈夫成长闪光点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3237">53:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;超感动求婚名场面</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3428">57:08</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;没人知道钱钱的工作是什么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3569">59:29</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;人物放大镜分析—Monica</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3588">59:48</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;偏心的父母和挑剔的母亲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3813">1:03:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;自卑的副作用：争抢好胜、强迫症</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3928">1:05:28</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;喜欢帮你打扫房间的朋友</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3986">1:06:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;总有渴望放纵的时候</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4113">1:08:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;不合适的人，当断则断</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4251">1:10:51</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;用努力成就自己的大女主</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4296">1:11:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;人物放大镜分析—Ross</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4306">1:11:46</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;讨人厌的“大直男”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4444">1:14:04</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;用魔法打败魔法：Ross &amp; Phoebe</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4683">1:18:03</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;越长大越相爱：Ross &amp; Monica</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4753">1:19:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;多愁善感的“小心眼男”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4915">1:21:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;人物放大镜分析—Rachel</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4920">1:22:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;小公主逃婚记</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5000">1:23:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;敢打敢拼的职场女性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5075">1:24:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;轰轰烈烈的闺蜜情：Rachel &amp; Monica</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5370">1:29:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;人气清醒女王Janice</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5523">1:32:03</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;他们都是肢体语言大师：Pivot</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5649">1:34:09</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;反转技巧直达情绪高潮：水母</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5906">1:38:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;快节奏喜剧技巧：30秒信息</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6053">1:40:53</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;那些让人难忘的配角</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6372">1:46:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;数不过来的大牌明星客串</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6506">1:48:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;老友记的魅力不只一点点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6527">1:48:47</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;分分合合、牢不可破的友情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6612">1:50:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;不被世俗束缚，自由的生活</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6751">1:52:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;跨越时代的文化价值</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6894">1:54:54</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;女性主义标杆作品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7151">1:59:11</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;老友记也有的现实局限：年龄焦虑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7314">2:01:54</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;我们最终都将走向家庭，和友情渐行渐远吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7633">2:07:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;老友粉问题答案揭晓</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhlADjtyMljv02pMdXcbiES1bNFQ.m4a" length="125371659" type="audio/mp4"/>
