  <item>
    <title>怎么会有人听我们的播客啊？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/649be9fefb908e66d599c30c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">649be9fefb908e66d599c30c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Jun 2023 08:06:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播小意，听了很多年播客，突然想自己做播客？</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播小白，收听时长，嗯....不长，但立马想做播客？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目将讨论，我们对“听播客”和“做播客”的那些“小想法”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>是不是也是你的“小想法”呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a> 为什么会有那么多人喜欢听播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 一听到北方话就莫名有好感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a> 对你来说，播客是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">09:18</a> 小时候听童书听出了阴影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">12:46</a> 看到哪种话题你会点进去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a> 天马行空的标题vs直给的标题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a> 为什么爱听闲聊类的播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1132">18:52</a> 谁听播客还没些小癖好呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1463">24:23</a> 为什么想做播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1662">27:42</a> 对播客的规划是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 有恶评怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2065">34:25</a> 天啊，我们怎么会想出这么中二的名字</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Walk Around by Roa | <a data-url="https://soundcloud.com/roa_music1031/" href="https://soundcloud.com/roa_music1031/">soundcloud.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>Music promoted by <a data-url="https://www.chosic.com/free-music/all/" href="https://www.chosic.com/free-music/all/">www.chosic.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>Creative Commons CC BY 3.0</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/" href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/">creativecommons.org</a></span></p>]]></description>
